ORG/1F80H               ; 3F00H  ADDITION R0+R1>R0  Cin:R2-0  Cout:R2-0
Add:
R0-0>A                  ;                 Return R6:MSB R7:LSB
OR R1-0                 ;                 Using R3, R4, R5
R0-1>A
OR R1-1
